Z||000000||contra||09-23-2000||08:01 PM||||Yeah<BR>I had <A HREF="http://www.hitechdev.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hitechdev.com</A>  fix my exhaust manifold crack by actually replacing the manifold itself. These guys were great, and really had alot of info on some questions i was wondering about. If you've ever wanted to see some extreme V8 conversions, even up to 600HP, or even some really awsome kitcars, then you should check them out. Their prices are very good, and their service was really quick and well done.<BR>they also do dyno testing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR>||||reg||1
